1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,980
IN-NANNA KIENET TAF KIF TAĦDEM L-AI.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:02,730
(u qatt ma rat kompjuter)

3
00:00:02,750 --> 00:00:03,980
7 QWIEL MALTIN LI JISPJEGAW L-AI

4
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:04,980
QAWL 7

5
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:06,980
“Bil-qatra l-qatra timtela l-ġarra.”

6
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:09,230
U l-AI? Hekk titgħallem: kelma b'kelma,

7
00:00:09,250 --> 00:00:11,480
triljuni ta' drabi.

8
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:12,980
QAWL 6

9
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:14,980
“Ir-ras meta tifliha tkun taf x’fiha.”

10
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,230
U l-AI? Lanqas min jibniha ma jaf eżatt x’hemm ġewwa.

11
00:00:17,250 --> 00:00:19,480
Għalhekk ix-xjenzjati qed ‘jiflu’ moħħha.

12
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:20,980
QAWL 5

13
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:22,980
“Qattusa għaġġelija frieħ għomja tagħmel.”

14
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:24,380
U l-AI? Kemm-il ‘r’ hemm f’ “Għargħur”?

15
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:26,230
Tweġiba mgħaġġla? Spiss ħażina.

16
00:00:26,250 --> 00:00:27,480
L-aqwa mudelli llum jieqfu u jaħsbu.

17
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:28,980
QAWL 4

18
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:30,980
“Ix-xogħol agħtih lil min jaf jagħmlu.”

19
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:34,230
U l-AI? Tagħmel l-istess:

20
00:00:34,250 --> 00:00:35,480
kull xogħol lill-għodda t-tajba.

21
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:36,980
QAWL 3

22
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:38,980
“Il-ġara tgħallmek tgħammar.”

23
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:41,230
U l-AI? Uriha eżempju…

24
00:00:41,250 --> 00:00:43,480
…u tagħmel bħalu. (fenek → fniek)

25
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:44,980
QAWL 2

26
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:46,980
“Il-giddieb għomru qasir.”

27
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:49,080
U l-AI? Xi drabi tivvinta — b'kunfidenza sħiħa.

28
00:00:49,100 --> 00:00:50,480
MHUX VERU. Jgħidulha ‘alluċinazzjoni’.

29
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:51,480
Iċċekkja dejjem.

30
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:52,980
QAWL 1

31
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:54,980
“Bil-kliem u s-sliem tasal kullimkien.”

32
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:57,480
U l-AI? Illum, bil-kliem tikkmanda l-magni.

33
00:00:57,500 --> 00:00:58,230
U l-Malti? Kliem ukoll.

34
00:00:58,250 --> 00:00:59,980
KELLIMHA BIL-MALTI.

35
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:00,980
In-nanna kienet taf.

36
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:03,480
Liema qawl insejna? Ikteb fil-kummenti.

37
00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:03,980
IN-NANNA KIENET TAF…
